<title>USA: GM prices electric vehicle lease from $33,995.</title>
<headline>GM prices electric vehicle lease from $33,995.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saturn Corp said on Tuesday they plan to offer the General Motors EV1 electric vehicle through a 36-month GMAC lease at a capitalized lease cost of $33,995.</p>
<p>Saturn said December 5, 1996 is the first day EV1 customers can take delivery of their vehicles through one of the 26 retail stores in greater Los Angeles, San Diego, Phoenix, and Tuscon.</p>
<p>The company said the sticker price could be considerably reduced by federal, state and local financial credits.</p>
